flowchart TD
  READY([Ready task in Taskgraph]) --> RENDER{brief.py}
  RENDER -->|"exit 2: unscoped task<br/>or config problem"| FIX[Fix it in Taskgraph<br/>or the config]
  FIX --> RENDER
  RENDER -->|"exit 3: STOP order"| HALT([Launch nothing])
  RENDER -->|"brief saved"| LAUNCH[Launch a fresh worker<br/>in its own worktree]
  LAUNCH --> FLIGHT[In flight]
  FLIGHT -->|"worker files its result:<br/>queue it, keep working"| DRAIN{Drain point}
  FLIGHT -->|"ended, no result:<br/>record DIED"| RETRY{Attempt 3 failed?}
  DRAIN -->|"PASS"| VERIFY{Verify, pinned to<br/>the Head SHA}
  DRAIN -->|"ISSUES: defects, or<br/>BLOCKED that evidence answers"| AGAIN[Fix round:<br/>next attempt]
  DRAIN -->|"ISSUES: ran out of time"| SPLIT[Split the work<br/>in Taskgraph]
  DRAIN -->|"BLOCKED: product call"| GATE[Gate for the operator]
  RETRY -->|"no"| AGAIN
  RETRY -->|"yes: abandoned"| GATE
  VERIFY -->|"verify-failed"| AGAIN
  VERIFY -->|"artifact- or test-verified"| TOKENS[Record time and tokens]
  TOKENS --> MERGE[Integrate: list branch as ready to merge,<br/>merge only if standing orders allow]
  MERGE --> DONE([tg done])
  AGAIN --> RENDER
  SPLIT --> READY
  DONE -->|"after the merge: claude rm"| CLEAN([Sessions and worktrees removed])
  DONE -->|"unblocks"| READY
